      "name": "fine_clothing",
      "change": "replace 'dye_plants': 0.20 with 'dyestuff': 0.16, keeping the capability floor on dyestuff",
      "why": "dye_plants -> dyestuff -> fine_clothing. Concentrated dye cake, not raw woad bundles, is what a tailoring town buys; this is the chokepoint that makes dyestuff worth carrying.",
      "proposedInputs": {"cloth": 0.42, "dyestuff": 0.16}
    },
    {
      "name": "cloth",
      "change": "optional - leave 'dye_plants': 0.12 as is",
      "why": "Everyday cloth is dyed on site with local plants; keeping cloth on dye_plants and fine_clothing on dyestuff is what makes the two tiers non-substitutable. Listed only so the choice is explicit."
    },
    {
      "name": "perfumes",
      "change": "add 'spices': 0.05 to inputs (no capability floor)",
      "why": "Clove and cinnamon oil are historically perfumery inputs and this gives the luxury tier one internal link instead of five parallel leaves. Low need so it does not hard-gate perfume on a spice coast."
